Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:11.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那都过去了  除非你不再去参加戒酒会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's in the past. Unless you've stopped going to your meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.44,0:12:13.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我们说好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. A deal's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.32,0:12:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:20.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.52,0:12:21.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh....
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拍照  - 我不太上相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To take a picture. - I don't take good pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:58.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 下班后打电话给我  好吗  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Call me when your, uh, shift ends, okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  八月时我会送她回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. I'll have her home by August.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开玩笑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:11.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 待会见  - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See you later. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:13.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你特地赶来  爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for everything, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:15.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定不需要我送你去上班  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure you don't want a ride to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.22,0:13:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用  走过公园就到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's just across the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:18.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  今晚玩得开心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Have fun tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.48,0:13:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:33.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:38.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪要来抓你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy's coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:43.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三  四  锁好你的门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, four, better lock your door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.36,0:13:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五  六  快去拿十字架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five, six, grab your crucifix.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.48,0:13:52.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七  八  彻夜不眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven, eight, better stay up late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  快跑  我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Run, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:26.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七  八  彻夜不眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven, eight, better stay awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.96,0:14:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九  十  他又回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine, ten, he's back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:00.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.28,0:16:54.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好  压住她  - 冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, now, hold her steady there. - Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:16:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么好害怕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:16:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照我的话去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do exactly what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.44,0:17:15.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么这一切又发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is this happening again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:19.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  别让他这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, please don't let him do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别惊慌  亚曼达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't panic, Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:25.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的胎位不正  宝宝臀部朝下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a breech birth here. It's backward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.20,0:17:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 我们得把宝宝转过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aah! - We're going to have to turn it around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:36.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你用力  用力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna need you to push. Now push.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.36,0:17:39.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push. Push.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.20,0:17:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:51.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.24,0:17:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姊妹  这是上帝的创造物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sister, this is one of God's creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.36,0:17:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得那样安慰自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take solace in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.84,0:17:58.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是上帝的创造物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is no creature of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:01.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  快把他交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it. Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小心  - 别让他逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch it. - Don't let it get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  又来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.80,0:21:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:17.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不可能又回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.36,0:21:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把你锁了起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I locked the door on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但我找到钥匙了 - 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I found the key. - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.68,0:21:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的出生是对人类的诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your birth was a curse on the whole of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让那种事再度发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not allow it to happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:47.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你召唤我回来让你重生  现在我要你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brought me back to give you life, but now I must take yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.72,0:21:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走着瞧吧  臭女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.20,0:21:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走着瞧吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll just see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.16,0:21:58.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我必须从我的人间监狱逃出来  - 该怎么做呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I must be released from my earthly prison. - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.44,0:22:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到高塔找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look for me in the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.12,0:22:06.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你永远都找不到她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.40,0:22:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾莉丝  - 安妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alice. - Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:29.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  还好是你  太可怕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, I'm glad it's you. It was terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.40,0:22:31.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事  - 我在梦里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? - I was in the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.64,0:22:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道是怎么一回事  但现在他回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't know how, but now he's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.44,0:22:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你死了  你迟到四小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were dead. You're four hours late.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.28,0:22:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.44,0:22:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论你有什么毛病  我希望我能开药治好你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I had a prescription for whatever it is you're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.28,0:22:47.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.52,0:22:51.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  谢谢你了  艾莉丝  再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, thanks a lot, Alice, for nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.36,0:23:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bombs away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.36,0:23:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.48,0:23:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟艾莉丝要去欧洲的事  你爸怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did your dad say about you and Alice going to Europe?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.44,0:23:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  他只是叫个不停  试着说服我相信我在虚掷人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. Just screamed a lot and tried to convince me I'm throwing my life away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.36,0:23:37.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁在虚掷人生  - 丹  他要跟艾莉丝去旅行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's throwing their life away? - Dan, and he's taking Alice with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.00,0:23:40.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳得好  伊芳  你一直都有练习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty good dive, Yvonne. You've been practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.48,0:23:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  每天两小时  每星期六天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. Two hours a day, six days a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.76,0:23:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再喝一瓶  你会需要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have another one. You need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.32,0:23:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  再过两小时我得上班  你何不下水呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I got a shift in a couple of hours. Aren't you going in?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.24,0:23:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我妈找了一个混蛋摄影师  到家里吃晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, my mom's got this asshole jerk-off photographer coming over to dinner...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.96,0:23:53.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不该把头发弄乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I'm not supposed to mess up my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.64,0:23:56.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不厌倦你妈老在命令你该做什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, aren't you sick of your mom trying to run your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.88,0:24:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是啊  - 别让他们那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Don't let them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.68,0:24:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然  没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.08,0:24:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说得对  有时候我觉得我跟墨利刻耳忒斯住在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, he's right. Sometimes I feel like I'm living with Melicertes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.52,0:24:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁  - 谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.72,0:24:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墨利刻耳忒斯  他是我在书上看到的古人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Melicertes. He's this ancient guy I read about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.84,0:24:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他杀了他的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who, like, killed his kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.88,0:24:14.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他不喜欢他们统治王国的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because he didn't like the way they were running the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.96,0:24:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的很奇怪  你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're really weird, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.12,0:24:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别提他们了  开香槟  我们得大玩一场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screw them. Open the champagne. Let's have a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.64,0:24:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吧  - 不  那是待会我跟艾莉丝要喝的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - No, no, that's for Alice and me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.32,0:24:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.48,0:24:31.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧  - 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay? - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.44,0:24:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  我一整晚都会想到那一幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, I could have gone all night without looking at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.00,0:24:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得这真的很奇怪  你画的漫画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's very strange how you draw all your comics...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.80,0:24:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都是鲜血淋漓的画面 - 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...Ioaded with blood and guts. - Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.16,0:24:42.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你害怕看到血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That freaks you out.
