Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.92,0:34:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有小男孩跟你住同一层楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There aren't any little boys on your floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.52,0:34:54.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定是从儿童病房溜出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he must have wandered in from the children's ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.24,0:34:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好奇他到底是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just wondering what's wrong with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.40,0:34:58.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有儿童病房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have a children's ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.52,0:35:01.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他穿着病人服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he was wearing a hospital robe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.48,0:35:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么跟你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.84,0:35:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你打电话给大家了吗  - 有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, did you call everyone? - Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.76,0:35:13.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  做梦的事  就当是你跟我的秘密  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, um, let's keep this dream stuff between you and me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.56,0:35:21.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚曼达·克鲁格是神职人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amanda Krueger was part of a religious order...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.88,0:35:23.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1940年代在那家精神病院工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that ran that asylum in the 1940s.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.08,0:35:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她被神经病强暴  在那里生下孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was raped by lunatics and had the baby there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.92,0:35:30.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子就是佛莱迪·克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That baby grew up to be Freddy Krueger...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.88,0:35:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在榆树街这里杀了二十到三十个小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who murdered 20 or 30 kids right here on Elm Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.56,0:35:39.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警方逮捕他  但他因为技术问题无罪开释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He got caught, but the courts cut him loose on a technicality.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.72,0:35:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死掉小孩的爸妈一起合作杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the parents of the murdered kids got together and killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.44,0:35:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他烧死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Torched him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.56,0:35:50.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那只是开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that was just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.08,0:35:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他继续杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He keeps on killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.52,0:35:56.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在他们的恶梦里行凶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he kills people in their dreams, their nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.96,0:36:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他利用我的梦  让他对受害者下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He uses my dreams to bring him his victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.60,0:36:04.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹的死全都是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my fault that Dan's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.56,0:36:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再那么说了  那是胡说八道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop saying that. That's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.48,0:36:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们谈谈宝宝的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's talk about the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.92,0:36:12.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  恭喜你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.84,0:36:15.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想是吧  - 那不是我们见面的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I guess. - That's not what we're here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.88,0:36:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹的爸妈一直在逼他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dan's parents were really pushing him hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.24,0:36:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在派对上抱怨  他的压力很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was bitching about it at the party. He was under a lot of pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.64,0:36:23.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们都一样  - 霸道的爸妈会把孩子逼疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We all are. - Pushy parents can drive you nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.96,0:36:25.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那跟这件事有什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that have to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.00,0:36:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹死的时候  你根本没在睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Dan died, you weren't even asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.60,0:36:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你说的  说那么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You even said so. End of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.44,0:36:40.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定找到别的办法了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must have found some other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.16,0:36:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.04,0:36:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't some kind of joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.44,0:36:49.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可以进入我的梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gets in through my dreams somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.96,0:36:52.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为我可以控制  但有些事改变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I thought I could control it, but something's changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.08,0:36:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道接下来他会做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I don't know what he'll do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.28,0:36:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  艾莉丝  我们知道你很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Alice, we all know you're upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.32,0:37:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉丝  重点是如果有人要伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bottom line, Alice if anybody's trying to hurt you...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.72,0:37:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论是不是超自然力量  他们都得先过我们这一关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...supernatural or not, they're gonna have to go through us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.96,0:37:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是一块的  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of us. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.16,0:37:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就担心会是那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'm afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.12,0:37:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戒酒会还好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was the meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.68,0:37:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我很清醒  - 很好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sobering. - Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.00,0:37:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾莉丝  - 你什么时候会聪明购物了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alice... - When did you become a smart shopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.84,0:37:52.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从我女儿要当妈妈后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since my little girl became a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.84,0:37:56.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对我失望吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You disappointed in me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.40,0:37:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.20,0:38:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我没有那么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.72,0:38:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望是个男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sort of hope it's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.00,0:38:13.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家里再出现男孩玩乐的声音应该会是件好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'd be nice to hear a boy playing around in the house again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.72,0:38:19.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但别把这当成习惯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't make a habit of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.88,0:38:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  大家老把我们误认为姊妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's true. People are always mistaking us for sisters. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.44,0:38:33.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛芮姐的身材很适合当模特儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greta certainly has the perfect body for modeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.76,0:38:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾琳·福特是我的朋友 - 哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know, Eileen Ford is a friend of mine. - Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.72,0:38:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟她提过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told her about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.48,0:38:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她非常有兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's very interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.16,0:38:45.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛芮姐  这是毕生难逢的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greta, you're being offered the opportunity of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.64,0:38:48.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你该表达一下谢意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you should show a little gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.52,0:38:51.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈  昨天我朋友死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of my friends died yesterday, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.04,0:38:54.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你介意我花几小时哀悼他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind if I take a few hours off to remember him?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.88,0:38:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在办晚宴  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're having a party, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.08,0:38:59.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到报导了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.12,0:39:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他喝醉了  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drunk or something, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.84,0:39:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只是葛芮姐的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he was just a friend of Greta's.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.64,0:39:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的关系不特别  他们没有在交往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not someone special. Not someone she was seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.44,0:39:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你了解的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.72,0:39:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  谢谢  我不饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No thank you. I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.68,0:39:18.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不吃吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.48,0:39:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really don't feel up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.52,0:39:24.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  亲爱的  你该吃点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, dear, you ought to try something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.08,0:39:29.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你一直要我注意体重  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one who's always slapping my hand about my weight, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.28,0:39:31.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们才节食  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why we diet, dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.48,0:39:35.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们才能在宴会上吃东西不会让其他宾客不愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so we can eat at social events and not upset the other guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.40,0:39:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.64,0:39:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我何不把整盘东西吃掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't I just eat the whole goddamn tray...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.96,0:39:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再跑去吐  等一下再回来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...go throw up, and come back for seconds, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.84,0:39:45.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夫人  让我来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madame, if I may.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.76,0:39:50.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你用餐愉快  笨女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bon appetit, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.44,0:39:55.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭比娃娃排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm. Fillet de Barbie. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.64,0:39:58.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛芮姐只要最好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing but the best for Greta.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.28,0:40:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,张开嘴巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.44,0:40:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.00,0:40:14.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃东西时别说话  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk with your mouth full, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.76,0:40:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你吃的东西会成为你的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are what you eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.56,0:40:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怜的孩子  好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, poor baby. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.92,0:41:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛芮姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greta.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.40,0:41:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.04,0:41:05.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸  快来帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, help.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.20,0:41:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛芮姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greta?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.40,0:41:38.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甜心  晚餐煮好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey? How's dinner coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.00,0:41:47.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不敢相信会发生这种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe this shit is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.72,0:41:50.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撑着点  伊芳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just hang in there, Yvonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.16,0:41:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.40,0:41:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  我知道马克一定吓坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I know Mark is gonna be wigging out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.60,0:41:55.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得撑下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just gotta keep tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.28,0:41:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会挺过去的  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get through, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.60,0:42:03.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道他就在这附近  女孩们  我想他真的很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know he's back here somewhere, girls. I think he's pretty upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.40,0:42:06.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.28,0:42:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.16,0:42:14.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 马克  你没事吧  - 我没事  只是很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mark, are you okay? - I'm fine, just aces.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.88,0:42:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要跟你们谈谈葛芮姐的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna talk to you guys about Greta.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.04,0:42:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉  但葛芮姐今天死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm terribly sorry, but Greta's dead today.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.32,0:42:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我们该谈谈别人的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps we could, uh, interest you in someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.00,0:42:25.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听着  那是意外  跟丹一样  - 那不是意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look, it was an accident, just like Dan's. - No accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.36,0:42:27.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你们警告过克鲁格的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to warn all of you about Krueger.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.76,0:42:30.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾莉丝  拜托  - 我想过那一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alice, please. - I thought about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.88,0:42:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一定是在吃饭时睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She must have fallen asleep while she was at the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.60,0:42:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这真的很变态  各位  - 太可怕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is getting a little sick, guys. - Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.88,0:42:37.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不了解发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.12,0:42:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁格得利用我的梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Krueger has to use my dreams...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.48,0:42:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他在我清醒时杀了丹跟葛芮姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but he got to Dan and Greta while I was awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.20,0:42:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是怎么办到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's he doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.40,0:42:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们两个为什么不能面对现实  - 你何不闭嘴听她说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why don't you two stick to reality? - Why don't you shut up and let her talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.16,0:42:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两天内我们之中死了两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two of us have died in the past two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.16,0:42:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得那很正常吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that strike you as particularly normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.32,0:42:54.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 马克  - 我还没有说完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mark... - I'm not finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.08,0:42:58.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非常爱葛芮姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I loved Greta, a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.00,0:43:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有人或有股力量杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if maybe, just maybe, someone or something killed her...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.88,0:43:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要知道真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'd Iike to hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.28,0:43:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不想再听这些废话了  - 那就给我滚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not gonna listen to this anymore. - Then get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.88,0:43:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.40,0:43:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊芳  等一下  对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yvonne, wait a minute, wait a minute. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.64,0:43:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个混蛋  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an asshole, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.20,0:43:25.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我处理得不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I'm not dealing with this very well...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.28,0:43:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这不是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but it's not your fault, and, uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.88,0:43:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.04,0:43:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.88,0:43:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能留下来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stick around for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.00,0:43:41.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的想留下来  可是  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could, but, uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.20,0:43:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚我有班  我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a shift tonight. I gotta get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.72,0:43:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你要的话  我可以留下来陪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll stay with you for a while, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.88,0:43:50.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大家再见  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye, you guys. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.32,0:43:52.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.24,0:43:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我是个白痴才会爱上她吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think I'm an idiot for being in love with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.92,0:44:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人那么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody thinks that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.44,0:44:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我根本没机会  可是  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I know I didn't stand a chance in hell, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.52,0:44:09.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她非常在乎你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She cared a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.16,0:44:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许是她妈害死她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe it was her mother who killed her...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.60,0:44:15.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她要求她必须完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with all that Polly Perfect shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.80,0:44:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟她妈无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.08,0:44:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚我们邀请到这些混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have these scumbags here on the hot seat tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.92,0:44:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魅影幽魂不会害怕跟她说出他心里的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Phantom Prowler wouldn't have been afraid to tell her how he felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.28,0:44:26.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望我有他十分之一的胆识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I only had a 10th of his guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.48,0:44:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  他并不存在  但他比我完美多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, he's not even real and he's more of a human being than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.52,0:44:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙不是你的漫画人物  马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy isn't one of your comic book characters, Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.04,0:44:36.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是魅影幽魂  他真的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not the Phantom Prowler. He's for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.16,0:44:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我克鲁格的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me more about this Krueger guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.44,0:44:43.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你似乎很累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.32,0:44:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帮你煮杯咖啡好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't I make some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.68,0:44:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该说的事太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a Iot to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.08,0:45:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.28,0:45:08.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.80,0:45:58.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.84,0:46:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.52,0:46:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 马克  - 救命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mark? - Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.20,0:46:30.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克  抓住我的手  快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark, take my hand. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.00,0:46:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.24,0:46:55.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克  快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.96,0:47:01.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw. Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.92,0:47:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.28,0:47:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.44,0:47:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.92,0:47:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的气色不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't look very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.28,0:47:29.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you feeling all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.48,0:47:32.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在做恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been having bad dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.92,0:47:37.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你住在这里吗  雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this where you live, Jacob?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.76,0:47:41.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在等人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.12,0:47:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛芮姐的事真的很惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's sad about Greta.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.84,0:47:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在等她吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that who you're waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.24,0:47:49.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.84,0:47:53.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你不该待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think this is a very nice place for you to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.56,0:47:55.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我们该去找你妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we should go look for your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.44,0:47:57.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不要我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She doesn't want me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.36,0:47:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信那不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm sure that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.88,0:48:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我敢说她非常担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll bet she's very worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.96,0:48:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我就会  - 不  你才不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I would be. - No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.64,0:48:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你甚至不在乎你要当妈妈了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't even care about being a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.68,0:48:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你没有想到我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come you don't think about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.48,0:48:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁说我  什么  - 我喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who said I... What? - I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.68,0:48:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要跟你在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.60,0:48:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你不喜欢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come you don't like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.20,0:48:17.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁说我不喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who said I don't like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.68,0:48:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那个有怪手的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend with the funny hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.48,0:48:24.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  甜心  我们得离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, honey. We're gonna get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.00,0:48:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我得走了  他在叫我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I have to go now. He's calling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.84,0:48:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各  等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.00,0:48:32.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.88,0:48:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.52,0:48:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他真的存在  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's really real, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.12,0:48:54.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.68,0:48:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对我的宝宝做了一些事  我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's doing something to my baby. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.48,0:48:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要伤害雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's trying to hurt Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.96,0:49:02.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 雅各是谁  - 我的宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's Jacob? - My baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.20,0:49:03.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  你已经帮他取名字了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you named him already?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.92,0:49:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我想是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.68,0:49:14.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得离开这里  到克鲁格找不到他的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta get away from here. Someplace where Krueger can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.52,0:49:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.44,0:49:19.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.20,0:49:21.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎能甩掉那个家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, how you gonna hide from a guy like that? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.28,0:49:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 离开地球表面  - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Leave the planet? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.48,0:49:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  如果你担心宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if you're worried about your baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.28,0:49:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打电话给伊芳  请她找医生帮你检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...call Yvonne and have the doctor check him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.40,0:49:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去查一下克鲁格的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go see what else I can find out about Krueger.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.88,0:49:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你吓坏我了  发生了什么事  - 克鲁格想伤害宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You had me scared. What's wrong? - Krueger's trying to do something to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.52,0:49:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉丝  甜心  不  我爱你  但你得控制一下自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice. Honey, no. I love you, but you're gonna have to get a hold of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.28,0:49:50.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克知道我没有发疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark knows I'm not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.32,0:49:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要他让你看看他的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask him to show you his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.52,0:49:54.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你需要冷静下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you just need to calm down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.12,0:49:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道他是如何在我清醒时杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I can't figure out is how he's getting in when I'm awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.16,0:49:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(产前检查室)
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.44,0:50:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未出生的胎儿会做梦吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do unborn babies dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.00,0:50:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  他们会做梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. They do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.68,0:50:06.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答应我一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But do us both a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.92,0:50:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跟摩尔医生提这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't mention any of this to Dr. Moore.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.20,0:50:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.68,0:50:15.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不敢相信你为了这件事要我在星期天早上找摩尔医生来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe you had me drag Dr. Moore down here on a Sunday morning for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.28,0:50:16.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  伊芳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Yvonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.84,0:50:18.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得这件事很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was something serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.88,0:50:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这还不够重要  我不知道这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this isn't serious, I don't know what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.72,0:50:25.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都别说  你会害我被开除的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't dare say a word. You're gonna get me fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.32,0:50:29.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩尔医生  未出生的胎儿会做梦吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Moore, do unborn babies dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.32,0:50:35.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胎儿在发展时  每天有七成的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As the fetus develops, it can spend up to 70 percent of its day...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.84,0:50:37.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,处在做梦状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in a dream state.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.44,0:50:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越大做梦时间越多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More as it matures.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.36,0:50:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我会感觉到宝宝的梦吗  - 艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will I be able to sense them? - Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.28,0:50:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你来这里的原因吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that why you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.28,0:50:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想知道你的宝宝  是不是在做恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To see if your baby's having nightmares?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.60,0:50:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是来做检查的  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here to find out everything we can, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.60,0:50:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说我找不到任何理由  在你这个怀孕阶段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankly, I have found nothing about you that would indicate the necessity...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.28,0:50:59.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮你做超音波检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of ultrasound at this stage of your pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.04,0:51:03.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是要确定宝宝没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanna make sure my baby's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.80,0:51:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心跳很强烈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the heart seems strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.48,0:51:10.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来看一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.16,0:51:15.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(病人：艾莉丝·强森 | 医生：摩尔)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.56,0:51:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's your baby
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.00,0:51:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮她冲洗一下照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her file.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.08,0:52:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到他跟他爸爸有多像了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See any family resemblance? Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.24,0:52:47.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂奶时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feeding time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.44,0:52:50.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我儿子要吃的灵魂食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soul food for my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.28,0:52:53.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别碰他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.52,0:53:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对我的宝宝做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he doing to my baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.72,0:53:03.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  小姐  冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, young lady, try to keep calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.24,0:53:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的宝宝很正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your baby is perfectly healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.68,0:53:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在看起来是有点大  但我认为还算正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little large for so early on, but as normal as I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.12,0:53:14.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他夺走他们的灵魂跟意识  要做出跟他一样的宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's taking their souls, their spirits, and making the baby like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.68,0:53:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  甜心  你累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, sweetie, you're tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.44,0:53:19.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带你回家后  你会舒服点的  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll feel better after I take you home and rest, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.20,0:53:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.16,0:53:22.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.20,0:53:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛芮姐跟丹在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greta and Dan were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.68,0:53:45.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁格杀了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Krueger killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.56,0:53:50.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他拿他们喂雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, he was feeding them to Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.24,0:53:51.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.96,0:53:55.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉丝  别再那么催眠自己  你知道你在说什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice, stop and listen to yourself. Do you know what you sound like?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.52,0:53:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来很疯狂  但我没疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Completely insane, but I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.20,0:54:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你是我的朋友  你会相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you're my friend, you would believe me a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.56,0:54:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你的朋友  我很担心你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your friend, and I'm worried sick about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.00,0:54:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该抛开那些怪想法  好好面对事实了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to leave the Twilight Zone and face reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.68,0:54:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 克鲁格真的存在  - 你的宝宝也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Krueger is reality. - So is your baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.56,0:54:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你得为自己着想  - 你以为我在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got more to think about than yourself. - What do you think I'm doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.88,0:54:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  信不信由你  克鲁格回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, whether you believe it or not, Krueger is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.80,0:54:25.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他找上我的宝宝  如果我不救他  谁能救他呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's after my baby, and if I don't try to do something about it, who will?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.36,0:54:31.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一副发疯的样子帮不了你自己或你的宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not doing yourself or your baby any good by acting like a crazy woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.60,0:54:32.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何不离开呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you take off?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.96,0:54:35.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开春木市  冷静一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave Springwood. Cool off for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.24,0:54:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊芳  你无法逃离这家伙的魔掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it, you don't just run away from this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.72,0:54:39.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会在你的梦里找到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He finds you in your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.68,0:54:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他找上我们之前已经杀了很多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He found a lot of other people before he found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.04,0:54:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你也一样  - 昨晚他邀请我去他家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You too? - He invited me to his house last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.04,0:54:50.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我们都累了  星期五晚上后我们都没睡好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, we're all tired, and we haven't had any sleep since Friday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.88,0:54:53.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是你还活着的唯一原因  - 不  才不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's the only reason you're alive. - No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.44,0:54:55.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊芳  看一下这些东西  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yvonne, look through this stuff, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.80,0:54:58.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她没发疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.12,0:55:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.72,0:55:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道接下来会发生什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.04,0:55:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁格利用雅各的梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Krueger's using Jacob's dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.76,0:55:17.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.56,0:55:23.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一个办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there is one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.36,0:55:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有想过不生下宝宝吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you thought about not having the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.08,0:55:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说没有宝宝  宝宝就不会做梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, no baby, no baby's dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.24,0:55:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我不能那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.24,0:55:40.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到他在我的身体里成长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw him inside of me growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.44,0:55:43.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我跟丹的一部分  我想留下他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's part of me and Dan. I wanna keep him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.16,0:55:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我们另外再想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, then we'll find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.36,0:55:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看过她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.76,0:56:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉丝  你能下楼来一下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice, can you come down a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.04,0:56:10.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.48,0:56:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.04,0:56:15.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔登先生跟我想过来看看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Jordan and I wanted to see how you're feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.16,0:56:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, come sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.56,0:56:23.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是好时候  或许你们得改天再来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This really isn't a good time. Maybe you could come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.52,0:56:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说  我们想知道  你打算怎么处理宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankly, we wondered what you intend to do with your baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.12,0:56:30.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I what?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.68,0:56:39.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想过了  我要留下宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've thought about it and I plan to keep him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.28,0:56:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们担心这对你来说  可能负担太大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were concerned that all this might be a little bit too much for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.28,0:56:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得当单亲妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, being single and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.12,0:56:56.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔登先生的意思是我们知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What Mr. Jordan means is that we're aware of the burden...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.56,0:56:59.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要你带大孩子的压力有多大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that raising a child would place on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.56,0:57:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想要帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.40,0:57:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想领养宝宝  把他视如己出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want to adopt it and to raise it as though it were our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.16,0:57:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我了解你们的用心  但不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I appreciate what you're offering, but, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.08,0:57:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.76,0:57:17.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也是我们的责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.68,0:57:19.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我们的孙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our grandchild.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.24,0:57:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桃乐丝  或许这不是个好点子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doris, maybe this wasn't such a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.32,0:57:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  艾莉丝  我们担心你现在的状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Alice, we're worried that in your present condition...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.44,0:57:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怕你没有能力照顾宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that you don't have the ability to take care of a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.32,0:57:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说我的状况怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about, my condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.20,0:57:41.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩尔医生打电话给我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a call from Dr. Moore.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.24,0:57:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说艾莉丝歇斯底里  出现了偏执幻想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said that Alice was hysterical and that she was having paranoid delusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.00,0:57:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.68,0:57:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道你吃了很多苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know you've been through a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.84,0:57:54.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在的重点不只是你的感受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but there is more at stake here than just your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.76,0:57:57.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不能带走我的宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not taking my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.64,0:58:01.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 或许法官不会同意你的说法  - 我支持她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, the courts might not agree with you. - But I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.76,0:58:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听够你们的胡官乱语了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard enough of this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.84,0:58:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你们能跑到我家  威胁我女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you can just walk into my house and threaten my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.08,0:58:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  我们在法律上有权这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, please, we have a legitimate claim to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.56,0:58:13.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是一样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.40,0:58:18.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的一部分  我不会把他交给你们或其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's part of me, and I'm not giving him to you or anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.00,0:58:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们认为我疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They think I'm nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.44,0:58:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是他们的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's their problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.00,0:58:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  那是我们的问题  马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's our problem, Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.60,0:58:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我不把问题处理掉  或许他们真的会把雅各带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't deal with this, they really might try to take Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.08,0:58:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你说她是自杀  - 对  报纸是那么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You said she committed suicide. - Yeah, that's what the papers thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.36,0:58:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一辈子都待在精神病院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She spent the rest of her life in the asylum.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.76,0:58:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁格案落幕后  她抓狂了  他们认为她是上吊自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After Krueger's trial, she flipped out, and hung herself, so they thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.28,0:58:57.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所以呢  - 他们无法证实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Meaning? - Meaning they couldn't prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.76,0:59:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找不到尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No body.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.32,0:59:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我看到她的坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've seen her grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.00,0:59:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是衣冠塚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, empty plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.68,0:59:07.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让人有地方可以追思她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A memorial stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.64,0:59:09.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空坟  他们没有真的埋葬她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vacant. They never put her under.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.12,0:59:11.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很酷吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.40,0:59:13.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.60,0:59:18.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果她是自杀  她的灵魂还在受苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she killed herself, her soul is gonna be in torment.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.84,0:59:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从哪里听来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.44,0:59:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这本书  里面有写到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right here, somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.52,0:59:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了"轮回"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. "Transmigration."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.84,0:59:36.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"罪人的灵魂"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Soul of the sinner."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.16,0:59:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了"被困在人间的安息地"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah. "Trapped in its earthly resting place."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.16,0:59:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在梦里她试着阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the dream, she was trying to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.00,0:59:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她告诉我该怎么做  然后门关上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She started to tell me how, then the door slammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.52,0:59:50.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是他干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must have done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.44,0:59:54.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得查出她在哪里死掉  释放她的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to find where she died to release her soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.40,0:59:56.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你保持清醒  看着我  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to stay awake and watch me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.00,0:59:59.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.40,1:00:25.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没来练习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you missed practice.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.20,1:00:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事  你谈恋爱了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened? Did you fall in love or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.36,1:00:30.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别问那么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.64,1:00:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本不想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't even wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.72,1:00:35.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泳池还开放着吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is the pool still open?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.80,1:00:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点的话  你应该能赶上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think if you hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.92,1:01:23.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚曼达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amanda!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.36,1:03:24.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.80,1:03:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来玩玩吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's rock 'n' roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.56,1:03:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里  小可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going, piglet? Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.24,1:03:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派对才刚刚开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The party's just starting.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.56,1:03:59.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你要做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know exactly what you're up to.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.96,1:04:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我要对伊芳下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I was up to, uh, Yvonne.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.00,1:04:10.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何不闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.88,1:04:31.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.76,1:04:35.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为亚曼达的关系  他不敢进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's scared to come in because of Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.44,1:04:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.56,1:04:41.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 天啊  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, God. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.04,1:04:45.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没发疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.80,1:04:49.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得找到亚曼达  她是关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to find Amanda. She's the key.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.44,1:04:51.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.64,1:05:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(来自地狱的恶梦)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.52,1:05:19.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(艾莉丝)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.08,1:05:29.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.60,1:05:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.20,1:06:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.08,1:06:30.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.64,1:06:35.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 - 哈哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.80,1:07:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 马克  救救我  拜托 - 哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mark, help me, please. - Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.80,1:07:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 葛芮姐  - 她真的很美味吧  还是我疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Greta? - ls she delicious or am I crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.64,1:07:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别碰她  - 你也来试试看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You leave her alone. - Try some.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.48,1:07:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧  你这个丑八怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to die, you scar-faced limp-dick.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.68,1:08:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比疯狂混蛋还快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster than a bastard maniac.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.96,1:08:24.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比神经病狂人还有力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More powerful than a loco madman.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.88,1:08:31.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是超级佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Super Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.12,1:08:35.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就说  看漫画对你没什么帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told you comic books was bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.04,1:09:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.40,1:09:21.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.24,1:09:29.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God. Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.96,1:09:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  那个房间里发生的事太不对劲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it. Nothing in that room was up to code.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.36,1:09:42.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们两个没死是个奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a miracle they both weren't killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.08,1:09:46.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  他不会伤害我  需要我活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he won't hurt me. He needs me alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.76,1:09:48.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁  她在说谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who? What's she talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.20,1:09:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  她只是很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one, officer. She's just very upset.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.60,1:09:54.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你们两个该到局里来一趟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe both of you should come down to the station.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.12,1:09:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊芳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yvonne.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.20,1:09:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊芳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yvonne.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.80,1:10:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事  马克在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on? Where's Mark?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.80,1:10:07.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.12,1:10:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁格杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Krueger got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.80,1:10:11.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.24,1:10:13.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  我要你坚强一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, come on. I need you to be strong now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.56,1:10:18.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我们得阻止克鲁格  不让他再对雅各下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, we have to get to Krueger before he gets to Jacob again.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.88,1:10:21.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we stop him?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.64,1:10:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通过亚曼达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.72,1:10:25.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得找到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we have to find her?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.96,1:10:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.28,1:10:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别要我再跟那家伙一起进按摩浴缸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't ask me to take a Jacuzzi with that guy again.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.84,1:10:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他试着用你分散我的注意力时  我人在高塔里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I was in the tower when he used you to distract me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.40,1:10:38.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.00,1:10:40.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.04,1:10:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你去我  跟你提过的那家精神病院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to go to the asylum, the one I told you about...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.92,1:10:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有事都是从那里开始  到那里找她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where all of this started and find her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.28,1:10:48.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉丝  你得跟我回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice, Alice, you're coming home with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.40,1:10:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  爸  我有事要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Dad, I've got something to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.36,1:10:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾莉丝  你得立刻跟我回家  - 爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alice, you're coming with me right now. - Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.96,1:10:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到亚曼达  快一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find Amanda, and hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.88,1:12:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快出来  克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on out, Krueger.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.80,1:12:35.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The game's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.84,1:12:49.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.08,1:12:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我比你强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was stronger than you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.20,1:12:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你对雅各下手  你这个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you picked on Jacob, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.88,1:13:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要他变得跟你一样  让你可以透过他的梦复活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're trying to make him like you so you can live through his dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.56,1:13:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.64,1:13:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了吗  克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear me, Krueger?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.68,1:13:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  如果你不跟我谈  或许会想跟亚曼达谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, if you won't talk to me, maybe you'd like to talk to Amanda!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.28,1:14:15.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来啊  你这个胆小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you fucking coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.76,1:15:21.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安  混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.96,1:15:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你真的朋友  雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your real friend, Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.04,1:15:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像你的父亲一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like a daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.04,1:15:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咯吱咯吱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cootchie-cootchie-coo!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.52,1:15:51.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 咯吱咯吱  - 哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cootchie-cootchie-coo! Ha, ha. - Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.04,1:15:53.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要搔你痒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotcha. I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.36,1:15:54.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要搔你痒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotcha, I gotcha....
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.64,1:15:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 妈妈  来见见我的朋友 - 哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mommy, meet my friend. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.32,1:16:01.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好  艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice try, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.48,1:16:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, babe.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.76,1:16:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的新造型  喜欢吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my new look. Like it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.68,1:16:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 妈妈  - 快下楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mommy. - Come downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.60,1:16:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会伤害你  他需要我们两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't hurt you. He needs us both.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.48,1:16:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我逮到你们两个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got you both. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.32,1:16:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  雅各  该回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Jacob, it's time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.76,1:16:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各  快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.76,1:16:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.16,1:16:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到爸爸这边来  雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to Papa. Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.96,1:16:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.96,1:16:53.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的  儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.68,1:16:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dan?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.68,1:16:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.44,1:17:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各  他不是你爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, he's not your father!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.72,1:17:21.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小孩子  总是让人失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids. Always a disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.20,1:17:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.56,1:17:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.28,1:17:58.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他躲在你的身体里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside you, where he hides.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.28,1:17:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.92,1:18:03.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他躲在你的身体里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where he hides out. Inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.40,1:18:05.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所以他找到我  - 怎么会呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's how he found me. - But how?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.12,1:18:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说那很容易  因为他太了解你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says it's easy because he knows you so well.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.44,1:18:21.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  克鲁格  这次我是玩真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Krueger, this time it's for keeps.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.76,1:18:51.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.84,1:18:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们可以好好认识彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we can really get to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.64,1:19:47.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.56,1:20:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.40,1:20:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.00,1:20:17.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各  艾莉丝赢不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, Alice will not triumph.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.84,1:20:20.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只有你能帮她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only you can help her now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.72,1:20:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, leave her.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.28,1:20:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧  我要跟你好好学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. I wanna learn stuff from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.32,1:20:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一点都不好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's no fun anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.04,1:20:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要教我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teach me? Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.92,1:20:51.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在  雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.64,1:20:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,释放他给你的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unleash the power he has given you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.28,1:20:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下课了  克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}School's out, Krueger.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.60,1:21:14.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.44,1:22:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.32,1:22:56.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带着你的孩子离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your baby and leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.24,1:23:14.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.80,1:23:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.92,1:23:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.64,1:23:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  小宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, little sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.56,1:23:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你做得很好  艾莉丝  - 丹也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You did good work, Alice. - So did Dan.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.60,1:23:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他还是让你没办法好好睡觉  - 没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ls he still keeping you up at night? - Oh, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.32,1:23:42.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还有一辈子的时间能睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has the rest of his life to catch up on his sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.12,1:23:44.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.12,1:23:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.64,1:23:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好睡吧  雅各·丹尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet dreams, Jacob Daniel.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.40,1:23:54.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, cutie.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.64,1:23:57.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的外孙还好吧  - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How's my little grandson? - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.76,1:24:00.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.80,1:24:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你饿了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.24,1:24:05.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们都饿了 - 哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We all are. - Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.76,1:24:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, sweetie.
